# Project Overview

## Product Name

Sales Intelligence Platform

## Platform Purpose

A universal, AI-powered sales intelligence platform that combines conversational AI with intelligent web scraping and master database management. The platform enables users to interact through natural language, scrape data from any website, manage contacts and companies, and enrich information automatically.

## Core Capabilities

### 1. Conversational AI Interface

- Natural language search bar as primary interaction point
- Multi-agent AI system powered by Gemini API
- Context-aware understanding and response generation
- File upload support (Excel, HTTP Archive files)

### 2. Intelligent Web Scraping

- Multi-agent scraping system (Analysis, Implementation, Validation)
- Automatic strategy selection based on website analysis
- Support for multiple scraping methods: CSS selectors, HAR parsing, OCR/ML, API detection
- HTTP Archive file processing when direct scraping fails

### 3. Master Database Management

- Centralized People and Companies datasets
- Automatic deduplication and data integrity
- Smart data enrichment through online search
- Inter-connected relationships across all entities

### 4. Data Quality Assurance

- 100% accuracy requirement - no confidence scoring
- Validation agents ensure data accuracy
- Online search and verification for missing data
- LinkedIn and web search integration

## Technology Stack

### Frontend

- Framework: Next.js with TypeScript
- UI Style: Excel-like tabular display
- Design: Subtle colors, sleek, interactive, professional
- Color Restrictions: No purple, indigo, lime, cyan

### Backend

- Runtime: Node.js with TypeScript
- API Design: Advanced REST APIs
- Authentication: JWT token-based
- Error Handling: Comprehensive error management
- Security: Production-level security measures

### Database

- Database: PostgreSQL
- Core Tables: People, Companies
- Design: Fully interconnected, properly indexed
- Integrity: Foreign key constraints, transactions

### AI Integration

- Primary API: Gemini API
- Framework: LangGraph for multi-agent orchestration
- Web Search: Online search capability for data enrichment
- Agents: Multiple specialized agents for different tasks

## Key Features

### Query Type 1: Database Queries

"Show me data of tech companies in San Francisco"

- Search existing database
- Return results in Excel-like view

### Query Type 2: Scraping Requests

"Can you scrape companies from this website?"

- Trigger 3-agent scraping system
- Analyze, implement, validate
- Add to database

### Query Type 3: Entity Lookup

"Find information about John Doe"

- Search People/Company tables
- If not found, search online
- Add verified data to database
- Return comprehensive information

### Query Type 4: File Upload Processing

"I've attached an Excel, add it to your database"

- Intelligent column mapping
- Handle mismatched headers
- Deduplicate and validate
- Insert into appropriate tables

### Query Type 5: HAR File Processing

"Use this HTTP Archive file to extract data"

- Detect HAR format automatically
- Parse HTTP Archive JSON
- Extract relevant data
- Process and add to database

## Code Quality Standards

- Production-level code, not prototypes
- Modular architecture following industry best practices
- Comprehensive error handling
- Security-first approach
- No use of decorative elements in code or documentation
- Clean, professional codebase

## User Experience Goals

- Seamless interaction through natural language
- Real-time visibility into agent operations (optional)
- Fast, accurate responses
- Excel-like data presentation
- Intuitive file upload handling
